{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act47side_level_act47side_06_beg","storyGroup":"act47side","storySort":13,"storyDependence":"act47side_level_act47side_05_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"UR-6","storyName":"交叉航线","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"娜斯提见到了锡人，得知梅兰德计划让莱茵为这次事故顶罪，娜斯提最终选择由她独自承担。拂哀菈听到娜斯提被定罪的消息，陷入了回忆。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act47side/level_act47side_06_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act47side_06","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":11,"next":13,"characters":["娜斯提","河谷孩子们的声音","拂哀菈的声音","菈玛莲的声音","哀珐尼尔的声音","克丽斯腾","协会成员","锡人","园区广播","梅希亚","拂哀菈","菈玛莲"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_bg_29_g1_outdoorbase.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2032_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","amount":"0","block":"true","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":13},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wind","id":14},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":15,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":16},{"type":"text","text":"风吹动年轻女妖手中的树叶，声音从其间掉落。","id":17},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_childrenlaugh","volume":"0.3","id":18},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_warmbonfire_loop","loop":"true","channel":"f","volume":"0.3","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"河谷孩子们的声音","text":"（萨卡兹语）再讲一个，再讲一个！","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈的声音","text":"（萨卡兹语）想不想听铁皮游侠的故事？","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈的声音","text":"（萨卡兹语）他还来过我们的河谷呢。如今笼罩着雾湖的雾，最早就是从他的大烟斗里飘出来的……","id":22},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2032_1#6$1","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":26},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magic_4","volume":"0.5","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲的声音","text":"（萨卡兹语）这样，就能让羽角收拢，遮住你的双眼。","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哀珐尼尔的声音","text":"（萨卡兹语）为了白天睡觉的时候当眼罩用？","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲的声音","text":"（萨卡兹语）不是，当然不是。是为了你在葬仪上流泪时，能从容地将那泪水编织成挽歌……","id":30},{"type":"text","text":"又一段声音播放完毕，年轻的女妖将叶片收进了怀里，她的眼神骤然变得警惕起来。","id":31},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2032_1#2$1","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"再偷听的话，我会把你扔进混凝土搅拌机里。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":35},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":36},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_68_i16.png","xScale":"1.4","yScale":"1.4","screenadapt":"coverall","x":"250","y":"-80","fadetime":"2","id":37},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act25side/m_avg_decisivebattle_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":38,"musicid":1},{"type":"imagetween","xTo":"100","duration":"60","id":39},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":41},{"type":"background","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"刚刚那是……女妖的咒言？","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"是。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"哥伦比亚与卡兹戴尔远隔千里，你走了这么远的路，却将族人的声音刻录下来带在身边，反反复复地聆听？","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"怀乡，很难理解？","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"……不难。但我确实很少见一个人怀乡时表情专注得像在看图纸。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"你在试图解读女妖的语言与行为模式，为什么？为了寻找一条足以改变整个族群数千年来生存困境的新路径？","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"你……","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我没那么自命不凡。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我只是，希望能让一个爱操心的家伙余生不那么有负担。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"理解，虽然听起来是同一件事情。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"请问有突破了吗？","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我不至于那么急躁。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"听起来，你已经把那些录音听过成百上千遍……","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"老是泡在同一个语料库里，直到溺死，也发明不出一种新的语言。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"目光与思维的局限会让我们溺死在“常识”里，然后一切都将变成所谓的“命运”……","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"我以为你正是意识到了这一点，才离开卡兹戴尔的。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"删除那些录音……一个残忍的建议。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"很合理。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"你好，我叫克丽斯腾，莱茵生命的总辖。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"娜斯提。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"斯特莱建筑公司新招的天才工程师，只需要旁人三分之一的时间便能完成工程的女妖，业内人都在传你的图纸上附着了巫术……","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"莱茵生命正在筹建工程科，或许你会有兴趣？","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我昨天无意中听到了你和老板聊天……“莱茵生命”，是一家涉及生物技术的科技公司？","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"娜斯提，抬头……看见那些羽兽和它们背后的晨星了吗？","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"我只是在寻找一种能让我们突破天空的力量。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"天空……","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"正如你刚刚的建议，如果要做成的事情已经超越常识，你需要的力量或许也并不来自我们身边……","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"莱茵生命更应该筹建的是科考科。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"很合理。我可以将这视作工程科主任给公司的第一条建议？","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2032_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":73},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":74},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":75},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":76},{"type":"charslot","id":77},{"type":"image","id":78},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":79},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#9$1","id":81},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_bg_68_g5_floatingstation.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":82},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":86,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"协会成员","text":"娜斯提女士？","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2046_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我以为你们会直接把我押去听证会的现场，或者其他更隐秘的监狱……而我们此刻却在索道站等缆车，看起来接下来是要参观浮空层？","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"协会成员","text":"想见你的那个人，确实是这样安排的。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2046_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":95},{"type":"charslot","id":96},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cablecar_loop","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":97},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":98},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":99},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cablecar_arrive","id":100},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"好久不见，娜斯提。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……原来是你。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#1$1","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"我刚到没多久，这里真是个好地方啊。我还差一半没有逛完，陪我一起？","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"也好。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":111},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":112},{"type":"charslot","id":113},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":114},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_bg_68_g6_floatinglabmodule.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":115},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":116},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#10$1","duration":"1","id":119},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"……为什么只有我们刚刚穿过的区域在下雨？","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"云端影棚。蓝卡坞开发了一套实时天空塑景系统，再等五分钟，你甚至可以看到极光。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"一百年前，那个被如今的人称作摄影之父的家伙在片场跟我感慨，说什么时候真的能在天上拍电影就好了……","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"“天空热”还真的推动了电影技术革命啊。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"这里真热闹，娜斯提。我自认为早就对生活的日新月异习以为常，此刻也不得不感慨哥伦比亚人的创造力。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"很难想象此时此刻你还有这样的闲情逸致。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"按照特区政府专为“螺旋桨天堂”制定的管理法案，紧急事件发生后的十二小时内，相关部门必须召开听证会，处理并公示调查结果。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"高登闯入莱茵的生态园，破坏了我们的在研项目，顺带着把他那些见不得光的生意暴露在了世人面前。","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"整件事情的证据链条完整且详实，你们很快来到了园区，却一直在推迟召开听证会……","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"这可不是拖延，娜斯提。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"两年前，哥伦比亚人绝不会想到自己有一天会和天上的云争抢居住权。可如今呢？","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"“螺旋桨天堂”已经成为整个哥伦比亚最受关注的存在，特殊地块备案名录里，它的名字被挪到了第一页。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"花上一点时间，坐缆车兜上一圈，看看身边的这些设施，看看堵在注册中心门口的公司代表们……","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"这所有的一切已经告诉了我们，听证会需要给出怎样的结论，不是吗？","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"“螺旋桨天堂”，啧，听听，“天堂”代表扶摇直上的狂热野心，而“螺旋桨”的意思也很明确——绝不能停下来。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"走私网络曝光，总长官牵头，涉及近百家入驻企业，园区这半年的科研工作存在大量违规……一旦彻查，接下来的展会便不得不叫停。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"你说得没错，娜斯提，听证会必须召开，这段时间的所有意外都必须要有一个交代——","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"但也只是一个交代而已。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"而“莱茵生命”是那个最合适不过的交代？","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"毕竟，这场“天空热”，本就是从特里蒙的那个夜晚开始。因为这前科，几乎不会有任何人质疑莱茵的再犯。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"唉，你从来都不像同行传言的那般，是个只知道闷头接电缆的技术工。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"不过，莱茵也并不冤枉，不是吗？","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"你们那棵来历不明的“树”还飘在天上，抛开“种植单元”之类的说辞，你要怎么向我解释？","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"听起来，我已经不用去听证会的现场了，毕竟你们早就做好了决定。","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"……抱歉，娜斯提。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":160},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":161},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":162},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":163},{"type":"charslot","id":164},{"type":"background","id":165},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_68_i16.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":166},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":167},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act25side/m_avg_decisivebattle_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":168,"musicid":3},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"……","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"虽然并不确定具体的时间，可我终究会回我的家乡，有人在等着我。","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"但在那之前，莱茵生命可以成为你旅途中的一站。","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"无论你想发明一种新的语言，建造一个新的河谷，还是改变那所谓的族群的“命运”……都没有人会干涉。","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"相反，莱茵生命会为你争取你所需的一切。毕竟，那里的很多人都和你很像。","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"条件呢？或者说……代价是？","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"娜斯提，我并不要求公司成员把“莱茵生命”的事业当作某种伟业，为它奉献或牺牲。","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"如果我们要做从来都没有人做过的事情，那便已经注定要面对足够多的怀疑与失去……","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克丽斯腾","text":"所以，永远都别停下来。","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……既然如此，我同意加入莱茵生命。","id":178},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":179},{"type":"dialog","id":180},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":181},{"type":"charslot","id":182},{"type":"image","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#1$1","id":185},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_bg_68_g6_floatinglabmodule.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":186},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":187},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":188},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":189,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"你我还在缆车上，说明事情还有可谈的余地，对吧？","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"嗯哼？","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"听证会必须召开，一切都必须有个交代，但也只是一个交代而已……","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"全哥伦比亚都知道，两年前的“地平弧光计划”，克丽斯腾窃取了国防部的投资，莱茵生命并未完全参与……但我确实是她的共犯。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"危及整个园区的罪责，由一家公司承担，还是由个人承担，性质截然不同。娜斯提，你愿意为莱茵生命牺牲到这个地步？","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"牺牲？我和克丽斯腾都不喜欢这个词。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"凡事都有代价，这是卡兹戴尔和河谷的生活教会我的道理。我不可能心甘情愿地充当梅兰德计划中的替罪者。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"……","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"我不会为难莱茵的其他人。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"以及那棵“树”。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"装置本身随你们处置，但请让我的助理研究员把数据带走，研究还没完成。他对我的项目并不知情，不用担心他动手脚。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":208},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cablecar_arrive","id":209},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"到站了。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"索道站的特工会送你去该去的地方。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"对了，有件事我想问你。之前回卡兹戴尔的时候，我去过一趟河谷……","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"拂哀菈来到了这里……我已经知道了。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我本来打算在听证会前，尽快找到她。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"（拂哀菈在园区……）","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"（呵，梅希亚，原来如此……）","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4151_tinman_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锡人","text":"我会派人安置我的这位老友。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4151_tinman_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"谢谢。","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":226},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheelfts","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":228},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":229},{"type":"dialog","id":230},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":231},{"type":"charslot","id":232},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":233},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_bg_68_g1_groundparkstreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":234},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":235},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_broadcast_third","id":236},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区广播","text":"有关“螺旋桨天堂”突发实验事故的听证会已于刚刚结束。","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区广播","text":"嫌疑人娜斯提·鲁诺瑞伊利用园区工程部负责人的职务之便，私自开展未经报备的实验项目，险些酿成重大事故。","id":239},{"type":"dialog","id":240},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":241},{"type":"charslot","id":242},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_bg_68_g3_highelevatorplaza.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":243},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区广播","text":"为掩盖犯罪事实，事发当晚，嫌疑人利用性质未知的树形装置袭击了正在执法的园区总长官高登·谭农。","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区广播","text":"据高登长官所言，除了涉嫌故意伤害，嫌疑人还存在滥用工程部的展品检修职权的行为。","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区广播","text":"她强迫下属进行非法检测，蓄意打压其他科技公司，迫使几十家优秀企业撤离园区。","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区广播","text":"现在，在烟酒施术单元以及源石制品管理局的支持下，被无辜牵连的企业已回到“螺旋桨天堂”，继续为哥伦比亚天空事业做贡献。","id":248},{"type":"dialog","id":249},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":250},{"type":"charslot","id":251},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_bg_68_g4_floatingplatform.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":252},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区广播","text":"目前，嫌疑人娜斯提·鲁诺瑞伊对其犯罪事实供认不讳，已被收押，后续将被送至特区法院接受相应的法律制裁。","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区广播","text":"“螺旋桨天堂”的后续运作，将在梅兰德应急管理监督协会的监督下，由高登长官和古斯塔夫长官负责……","id":255},{"type":"dialog","id":256},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":257},{"type":"charslot","id":258},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_bg_hotel.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":259},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":260},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区广播","text":"……万众瞩目的“天空生活展会”将不会受到任何影响。","id":262},{"type":"dialog","id":263},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_imp_funnel_end_h","id":264},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#5$1","duration":"1","id":266},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"拂哀菈女士……吵到您了吗？抱歉。","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#9$1","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"娜斯提……她怎么了？","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_2035_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#10$1","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"……别去想那些了，女士。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"就让您对娜斯提主任的记忆，停留在您昨晚见到她的时候吧。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":274},{"type":"text","text":"年轻的特工将手搭上老旧的幻灯机，轻柔地拨动起转盘，像是在拨弄纤细的丝线，记忆的丝线。","id":275},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection_loop","loop":"true","channel":"f","volume":"0","id":276},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":277},{"type":"text","text":"梅兰德应急管理监督协会，以监督政府机构应急管理措施的名义，介入哥伦比亚的一切事故。因为事故，是最易被捏塑的事实。","id":278},{"type":"text","text":"锡人总是调侃，协会的手段比约翰老妈的货品清单还要丰富，其中自然也包括梅希亚的源石技艺——","id":279},{"type":"text","text":"对记忆的抹消。","id":280},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"0.5","id":281},{"type":"text","text":"同样的动作，梅希亚已经做过百次、千次。但此刻，她拨动转盘的手，却僵在了半空。","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#7$1","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"不……至少不该对一位记忆本就所剩无几的老人。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"况且，今天被篡改的事实已经够多了。","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"迟开的听证会，心满意足的企业代表，混入人群的特工同僚……锡人前辈的任务究竟是什么？","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"巡逻的人手越来越多，我能为您做的已经越来越少——前辈发现我的隐瞒只是时间问题。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#10$1","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"但如果您无论如何都还是放心不下娜斯提主任，我会想想办法……","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#5$1","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"娜斯提……对不起，我的女儿。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2035_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#8$1","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"……","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#5$1","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"是我害你……无家可归。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2035_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":296},{"type":"dialog","id":297},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":298},{"type":"charslot","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":300},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":301},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_bg_68_g12_valleytree.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":302},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":303},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_mnwtrfll","loop":"true","channel":"pb","volume":"0","id":304},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"pb","fadetime":"2","id":305},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","amount":"0","block":"true","id":306},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_enchantress_sad","volume":"0.3","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"“炬火之所往，众魂之所在。”","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"“骨归于骨，魂归于魂。”","id":309},{"type":"dialog","id":310},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"pb","fadetime":"5","id":311},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":312,"musicid":5},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1071_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#8$1","duration":"1","id":314},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":315},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1071_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"这场葬礼就到此为止吧，拂哀菈。族人们都已经回庭院了，夜晚要来了。","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"三个月。德莫伊在栖脚树下的木屋熬过了整整三个月，才等来死亡。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"能做的，我都做了，但……慢慢变成一具空壳的痛苦，我缓解不了。","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"她向来不是个哀愁的人，湖岸的整片芦苇都会因她的笑声而飘荡起来。","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"但这两百年来所有称得上愉快的记忆，在她搬进木屋的最初三天，就消散殆尽，不留一丝痕迹，我想拾，都拾不起。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"余下的三个月里，当其余的记忆也弃她而去，她就只能从喉咙里挤出断断续续的嘶声。","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1071_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"至少，在生前的两百年间，她确实有过许多欢笑。","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"那究竟是为何，她最终还是不得不在痛苦中死去？","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"两百年来，自我们定居河谷以来……每一位逝去的女妖，都在死前经历过这样一场漫长而痛苦的遗忘。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"简直像是个残忍的玩笑。对逝者而言，女妖本是最后铭记他们存在的人。遗忘从不是我们的天性，铭记才是。","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1071_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"遗忘确实是这两百年间的新事，但你总不该为一种我们尚不了解的顽疾而自责。","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"顽疾吗，还是代价？","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"每次，每个人，最先消散的记忆，总是有关河谷生活的那些。","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"简直好像……我们所创造的生活，从来都只是棉花一样的填料，我们用它替代了族人天性使然的生活方式，可到头来……","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"当它随着时间腐朽，被它填满的人，就只剩下空壳。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1071_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"我们本来要做的，不就是这样的事吗？","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"为女妖、为萨卡兹，创造一种不同以往的生活——一种与歌声和糕点，而不是战争和死亡相伴的生活。","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"殿下也向我们许诺过，记得吗？我们在河谷经营这一切的同时，她会以魔王的身份，引导族群告别久积的仇怨与杀戮的天性。","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"你亲口告诉过我，殿下已经转而向源石寻求答案了……与那位“勋爵”一同。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1071_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"我后来又与殿下有过几次交谈。她从没忘记过我们曾经的理想。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"她只是换了一种更决绝的方式去履行诺言。若有朝一日，她的花海能开满大地……萨卡兹只会更需要一种新的生活。","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"但愿河谷还能撑到那个时候。","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"栖脚树仍在枯萎，它的根系已经开始腐败。土石之子的巫术、我自己的咒言，都没能起效。","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1071_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"栖脚树的事，无论如何都会有办法的。我只愿……你还能看见那个未来。","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"这三个月来，你为了陪伴德莫伊，可曾有一个晚上合过眼？","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"她至少能在你咒言的安抚下，听一听雾湖的水声和舟楫声，获得片刻的安宁。","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"可你自己呢？","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"德莫伊一走，经历过两百年前那场战争的女妖，也只剩你我了。","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"这些代价，只能由我来承担。","id":356,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1071_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"还有孩子们呢，不是吗？","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"所以，你才把哀珐尼尔送去了卡兹戴尔？","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1071_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"女妖的未来，总该交给孩子们的。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"不论我们的决定是对是错，都不该让孩子们去承担代价。","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1071_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"……所以你才没让娜斯提参加这场葬礼？","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"幸好我没让她来。如果河谷的生活依然只是棉花填料一样脆弱的存在，那……","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"娜斯提是在卡兹戴尔挣扎着长大的孩子，死亡在她眼里，就只是满地冒出来的源石晶簇。","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"面对死亡，她的态度一定会让其他孩子生疑。","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1071_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"她是个聪明的孩子，不会不明白你的意图。","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"当年，她想把自己的树屋搭在栖脚树边上，可最终，你还是让她搭在了生长着雾芯果的林地。","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"你几乎不带她来族人们聚会的庭院，也不允许她系统地学习咒言和挽歌……你是怎么向她解释的？","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"孩子们太吵闹了，我这个“管家”不得不住远一些躲清静。我的忙碌她看在眼里……","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1071_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"她信了？","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"起码没说什么。","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1071_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"……","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"好了，菈玛莲，你回去吧。","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1071_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"你呢？","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"我想再待一会。","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1071_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"这首挽歌，你唱得够久了。","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"……我只是不知道自己还能做些什么。河谷在步入腐败，而河谷之外，那些因我的过错而无处可归的魂灵，仍在悲泣。","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1071_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"至少，你还可以回去陪陪娜斯提。","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"作为母亲，我们不一定能承受把孩子关在门外的代价。","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈玛莲","text":"你关上那扇门，只是为了隔绝一些残忍的真相。可对孩子而言，你是在将她推远……","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1071_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":397},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkmeadow","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-150,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":399},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":400},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2048_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"……","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"这些天，我不是没有预感到过，娜斯提的离去……","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_2048_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":404},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":405},{"type":"charslot","id":406},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_68_i05_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":407},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0.1","id":408},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0.1","id":409},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":410},{"type":"background","id":411},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_068cg_birds","layer":"1","y":"-150","x":"-100","id":412},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":413},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我只是没有想到，这一天会来得如此快。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":414},{"type":"subtitle","id":415},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":416},{"type":"bgeffect","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"确实是个唐突的决定。","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"……","id":420},{"type":"dialog","id":421},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":422},{"type":"charslot","id":423},{"type":"curtain","id":424},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_cnclouds","layer":"1","id":425},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_68_i05_1.png","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","screenadapt":"coverall","x":"50","y":"-70","fadetime":"0","id":426},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_breezeblow_amb","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":427},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":428},{"type":"delay","time":"0.25","id":429},{"type":"imagetween","xTo":"-100","duration":"60","id":430},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_boat_lake_loop","loop":"true","channel":"sl","volume":"0","id":431},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"sl","fadetime":"2","id":432},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":433},{"type":"text","text":"一艘单薄的小船顺流而下，年老的女妖用咒言催动着它，向河谷之外驶去。","id":434},{"type":"text","text":"芦苇摇荡，薄雾隐去了湖面上的落叶。因为看不出季节，所以无法定义这场离别的底色。","id":435},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"sl","fadetime":"2","id":436},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"我本来希望，你可以在河谷中安然度过余生。","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"没能更早地找到你，本就是我的过失。你已经为此吃了太多的苦。","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"决定将你带回河谷时，我便应该为此负责。可最终……","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"请原谅我的矛盾，娜斯提。","id":440},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我离开不是因为你，拂哀菈。","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……起码不是出于你以为的原因。","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"不像那些孩子，你清楚卡兹戴尔如今仍是那般……","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"活人还是在充斥着铁锈和粪便味的集市上打架，死人身上的结晶还是像野草一样从身体里冒出来……","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"那地方没有我要的答案。","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"可你的问题是什么呢？","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":447},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"那、那你打算去哪里？","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我不知道。或许，我会用从你那儿偷学来的半吊子咒言，在谷口扔几块石头，让它们为我决定一个方向。","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"莱塔尼亚？拉特兰？哥伦比亚？","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"还在卡兹戴尔流浪的时候，我听说过这些陌生的名字。","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"那些地方啊……","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"那些地方好遥远……","id":453},{"type":"dialog","id":454},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"怎么了？","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"……","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"注意安全，好好吃饭，孩子。","id":458},{"type":"text","text":"沉默良久，拂哀菈只说出了这么一句。","id":459},{"type":"text","text":"年老的女妖在为人报丧的途中行走过千万里路，可她突然意识到，那些地名对她而言同样陌生。","id":460},{"type":"text","text":"远行的养女即将开启一段旅程，但她无从想象旅程的终点是什么景象，更不知道该叮嘱些什么。","id":461},{"type":"text","text":"行船的水声悠悠，娜斯提没有回头。","id":462},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"再见……母亲。","id":463},{"type":"dialog","id":464},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":465},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sl","fadetime":"2","id":466},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":467},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":468},{"type":"bgeffect","id":469},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":470},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":471},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":472},{"type":"image","id":473},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":474}],"characters":["娜斯提","河谷孩子们的声音","拂哀菈的声音","菈玛莲的声音","哀珐尼尔的声音","克丽斯腾","协会成员","锡人","园区广播","梅希亚","拂哀菈","菈玛莲"]}